			<item>
				<title>3D model manifest</title>
				<link>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/3d-model/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 15 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/3d-model/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;3d-model-manifests&#34;&gt;3D model manifests&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;GLB resources are emitted as Presentation API 4 &lt;code&gt;Scene&lt;/code&gt; containers with painting annotations of the type &lt;code&gt;Model&lt;/code&gt;. The &lt;code&gt;bare.glb&lt;/code&gt; resource has no sibling poster image — its Scene simply has no thumbnail, the build doesn&amp;rsquo;t fail. See &lt;a href=&#34;https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/iiif/page-metadata/#3d-models/&#34;&gt;Page metadata&lt;/a&gt; for the full rules.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title></title>
				<link>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/post-specific-assets/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/post-specific-assets/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Make sure the &lt;code&gt;assets&lt;/code&gt; directory is mounted (in &lt;code&gt;hugo.toml&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;config.toml&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;module&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  [[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;module&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;mounts&lt;/span&gt;]]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;      &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;source&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;assets/scss&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;      &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;target&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;assets/scss&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  [[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;module&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;mounts&lt;/span&gt;]]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;      &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;source&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;assets/js&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;      &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;target&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;assets/js&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  [[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;module&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;mounts&lt;/span&gt;]]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;      &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;source&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;assets/ts&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;      &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;target&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;assets/ts&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add a reference to the front matter&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34; data-lang=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;scss&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;scss/tag-ring/tag-ring.scss&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;js&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  - &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;ts/tag-ring/tag-ring.ts&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Developing shortcodes</title>
				<link>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/development/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/development/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;seting-up&#34;&gt;Seting up&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To use the example site locally you need to set up the language files:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;./scripts/setup.sh&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;running-the-example-site&#34;&gt;Running the example site&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo --themesDir ../.. --printI18nWarnings --printUnusedTemplates&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Afterwards the example site can be generated or &lt;code&gt;serve&lt;/code&gt;&amp;rsquo;d.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;cleaning-up&#34;&gt;Cleaning up&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Before commiting changes one can clean up the language files:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;./scripts/cleanup.sh&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Quality assurance scripts</title>
				<link>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/qa-scripts/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/qa-scripts/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The theme ships a set of quality assurance scripts, used by the &lt;a href=&#34;../development/&#34;&gt;example site&lt;/a&gt; and by sites built on this theme in their CI workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;browser-check&#34;&gt;Browser check&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;scripts/github/check-js-errors.sh&lt;/code&gt; wraps &lt;code&gt;scripts/check-js-browser-errors.mjs&lt;/code&gt; and is the form used in GitHub Actions. The Node script serves the built site from the &lt;code&gt;docs&lt;/code&gt; directory on an internal web server (&lt;code&gt;http://localhost:3000/&lt;/code&gt;), loads every page from &lt;code&gt;test-urls.json&lt;/code&gt; (or one URL per line from &lt;code&gt;test-urls.txt&lt;/code&gt;) in headless Chrome and fails the run if a page emits errors:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Site parameters</title>
				<link>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/site-params/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/site-params/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;js&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;esm&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;iiif&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;presentationViewer&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;ts/iiif/tify.ts&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;css&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;includeDirs&lt;/span&gt; = [&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;node_modules/tify/dist/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Webmentions</title>
				<link>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/webmentions/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://cmahnke.github.io/projektemacher-base/posts/webmentions/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The theme advertises a &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.w3.org/TR/webmention/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;webmention&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;endpoint in the document head when &lt;code&gt;params.webmentions.endpoint&lt;/code&gt; is&#xA;configured:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;webmentions&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;endpoint&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;https://webmentions.example.org/endpoint.php&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;advertisePingback&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Received mentions are collected by the theme&amp;rsquo;s&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/cmahnke/projektemacher-base/blob/main/services/webmentions/README.md&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;PHP collector&lt;/a&gt;,&#xA;synced to the repository&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;webmentions&lt;/code&gt; data branch and fetched into&#xA;&lt;code&gt;data/webmentions/mentions.json&lt;/code&gt; at build time. The list below renders&#xA;the entries for this page (sample data for this demo):&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;webmentions&#34; id=&#34;webmentions&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h2 class=&#34;webmentions-title&#34;&gt;Mentions&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;      &lt;ul class=&#34;webmentions-list&#34;&gt;&lt;li class=&#34;webmention webmention-reply&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;webmention-meta&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;webmention-source&#34; href=&#34;https://example.org/notes/a-reply-to-projektemacher&#34; rel=&#34;noopener nofollow&#34;&gt;Anna Example&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;webmention-type&#34;&gt;Reply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;time class=&#34;webmention-date&#34; datetime=&#34;2026-10-20T09:15:00Z&#34;&gt;2026-10-20&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;webmention-title&#34;&gt;A reply to the projektemacher base theme&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;webmention-content&#34;&gt;This demo shows how received mentions are rendered by the theme. Content is plain text, sanitized by the collector.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&#34;webmention webmention-like&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;webmention-meta&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;webmention-source&#34; href=&#34;https://example.org/likes/projektemacher-base&#34; rel=&#34;noopener nofollow&#34;&gt;Bob Example&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;webmention-type&#34;&gt;Like&lt;/span&gt;&lt;time class=&#34;webmention-date&#34; datetime=&#34;2026-10-20T10:30:00Z&#34;&gt;2026-10-20&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&#34;webmention webmention-mention&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&#34;webmention-meta&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;webmention-source&#34; href=&#34;https://example.org/linkdump/2026-10&#34; rel=&#34;noopener nofollow&#34;&gt;Linkdump 10/2026&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;webmention-type&#34;&gt;Mention&lt;/span&gt;&lt;time class=&#34;webmention-date&#34; datetime=&#34;2026-10-21T08:00:00Z&#34;&gt;2026-10-21&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;webmention-title&#34;&gt;Linkdump 10/2026&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/section&gt;</description>
			</item>
	</channel>
